    "id": "elk-1d359495-495d-45d7-b040-59795199e5d8",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-1d359495-495d-45d7-b040-59795199e5d8">If you're anything like me, you've been counting down the months until you can finally slip on a pair of sandals and head out the door with ease. I’m happy to report that sandal season has officially arrived — and I’m celebrating the occasion by snagging a discounted pair of Birkenstocks.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p>Birkenstock makes a variety of versatile shoes that complement nearly every outfit and every weather forecast. Even better? Both <a href="https://nordstromrack.sjv.io/c/221109/1961164/23941?subId1=tomsguide-us-5657432720248076198&amp;sharedId=tomsguide-us&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nordstromrack.com%2Fbrands%2Fbirkenstock%3F" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener">Nordstrom Rack</a> and <a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-8900245-8417500?sid=tomsguide-us-8521470907132366101&amp;url=https://www.zappos.com/birkenstock/YgLCAeABAeICAgwc.zso" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener">Zappos are knocking up to 40% off select styles of Birkenstock sandals and clogs</a> — and I couldn't be more excited to grab a pair.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "aria-hidden": "true",
        "class": "paywall",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="paywall">Sure, the shoes can be a bit pricey, but I've rounded up a few of my favorite discounted Birkenstocks from the sale and they're the perfect styles for spring. If you're ready to upgrade your footwear for the new season, keep scrolling to check out all these rare Birkenstock deals now.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
