  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": "elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f">In a sit-down <a href="https://youtu.be/Sr6n-9mzYnk" target="_blank">interview with David Senra</a>, Snap CEO Evan Spiegel shared some more details about the vision of Snap Specs ahead of their consumer release later this year. Besides taking a swing at Meta in the chat, it’s fair to say the conversation got weird…in an interesting way.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p>"What if aliens are…sending these glasses to save people from their lives that I think have become so oriented around screens,” Spiegel posed. My immediate thought was to email Snap and ask for whatever Spiegel’s smoking, because it sounds awesome.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f-2",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": "elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f-2",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f-2">But as someone who is already high on the idea of smart glasses being the next generation of portable computing, it started to click as he defined the smartphone as a “biological disaster” and talked about computers pulling us all “away from one another” and into a “single player experience.” Let’s go into what he said and map that with <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/snap-os-is-finally-ready-for-snap-specs-in-2026-i-just-tested-the-game-changing-update">my time testing Specs</a>.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Article continues below</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>You may like</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "flex flex-col gap-0 m-0",
      },
      "tag": "ul",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<ul class="flex flex-col gap-0 m-0"> <li> <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/snap-and-qualcomm-team-up-for-the-future-of-specs-aiming-to-make-smart-glasses-more-human-and-grounded-in-the-real-world" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse"> <span>Snap and Qualcomm team up for 'the future of Specs' — aiming to make smart glasses 'more human and grounded in the real world'</span> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/exclusive-viture-co-founders-are-planning-invisible-ai-glasses-to-rival-meta" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse"> <span>Exclusive: Viture Co-founders are planning ‘invisible’ AI glasses to rival Meta</span> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/meta-ray-ban-display-review" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse"> <span>I’ve been wearing the Meta Ray-Ban Display smart glasses for a week — they’re great, but they could be so much more</span> </a> </li> </ul>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Evan Spiegel: Turning Down a Billion Dollars - YouTube</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "alt": "Evan Spiegel: Turning Down a Billion Dollars - YouTube",
    "component": "image",
