  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>and are aged 16 or over.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "sm:text-xl text-base font-bold text-black mb-3 p-0",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="sm:text-xl text-base font-bold text-black mb-3 p-0"> You are now subscribed </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm sm:text-base",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm sm:text-base"> Your newsletter sign-up was successful </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>An account already exists for this email                                        address, please log in.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Subscribe to our newsletter</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "crosshead",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "boxout__title",
      },
      "tag": "h5",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "Quick Summary",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> Google has confirmed that the Gemini-enhanced Siri and next-gen Apple Intelligence will be available later in 2026. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> The company commented on its partnership with Apple at the Google Cloud Next '26 conference. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": "elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9"> In an unexpected move, <a href="https://www.t3.com/tag/google">Google</a> has commented on the work between <a href="https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apple-confirms-decision-that-will-radically-change-your-iphone-forever">Gemini and Apple</a>, something we rarely see from this sort of partnership. They came from Google Cloud CEO Thomas Kurian during the Google Cloud Next '26 opening keynote. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "aria-hidden": "true",
        "class": "paywall",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="paywall"> The annual conference focuses on developments in the cloud space across the Google ecosystem and is currently taking place in Las Vegas. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9-2",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": "elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9-2",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9-2"> "We’re collaborating with <a href="https://www.t3.com/tag/apple">Apple</a> as their preferred cloud provider to develop the next generation of Apple Foundation Models based on Gemini technology," the Google Cloud CEO said according to <a href="https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/22/google-teases-gemini-powered-siri-upgrade-during-cloud-next-keynote/" target="_blank">9to5Mac</a>. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Article continues below</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>You may like</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "flex flex-col gap-0 m-0",
      },
      "tag": "ul",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<ul class="flex flex-col gap-0 m-0"> <li> <a href="https://www.t3.com/tech/ai/gemini-powered-siri-still-on-track-for-2026-release-apple-tells-major-outlet" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row"> <span>Gemini-powered Siri "still on track" for 2026 release – Apple tells major outlet</span> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apple-could-reveal-new-gemini-powered-siri-in-less-than-a-month-iphone-updates-could-even-arrive-soon" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row"> <span>Apple could reveal new Gemini-powered Siri in "less than a month" – iPhone updates could even arrive soon</span> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.t3.com/tech/laptops/why-wait-for-super-powered-siri-gemini-for-macos-already-enters-beta-test-phase" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row"> <span>Why wait for super-powered Siri, Gemini for macOS already enters beta test phase</span> </a> </li> </ul>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> "These models will help power future Apple Intelligence features, including a more personalised Siri coming later this year," he added. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> It was known from the outset that Apple had turned to Google to develop these new Foundation Models, which sit behind services like Siri and Apple Intelligence. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> The addition of "a more personalised Siri" along with the release date of "later this year" reinforces the timeline that we're all working to, with an updated Apple Intelligence and smarter Siri at some point in 2026. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "alt": "Cloud Next 26",
    "caption": "",
    "component": "image",
    "credit": "                          (Image credit: Google / YouTube)                        ",
    "errors": [],
    "html": "                                                                                              ",
    "id": undefined,
    "imageurl": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/33RaJ9JmYp2kZQSsdFaLrj.jpg",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "elk-851b94cb-4e33-488a-83d7-e55a262ff705",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": "elk-851b94cb-4e33-488a-83d7-e55a262ff705",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-851b94cb-4e33-488a-83d7-e55a262ff705"> The partnership was first announced in January 2026, with some seeing it as admission that Apple hadn't achieved what it wanted to with its AI offering. Others see it as a savvy manoeuvre, giving Apple access to a great service while AI companies battle it out for dominance. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Sign up to the T3 newsletter for smarter living                                straight to your inbox</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "newsletter-form__strapline",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="newsletter-form__strapline"> Get all the latest news, reviews, deals and buying guides on gorgeous tech, home and active products from the T3 experts </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Contact me with news and offers from other                                    Future brands</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "errors": [],
    "text": "<p>Receive email from us on behalf of our                                    trusted partners or sponsors</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "footer",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "newsletter-form__footer",
      },
      "tag": "footer",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "By submitting your information you agree to the <a href="https://futureplc.com/terms-conditions/" target="_blank">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> and <a href="https://futureplc.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> and are aged 16 or over.",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> It's expected that this enhanced version of Apple Intelligence will be part of <a href="https://www.t3.com/tag/ios">iOS</a> 27, which should be released in September 2026, likely making its debut on the <a href="https://www.t3.com/tag/iphone">iPhone</a> 18 Pro models and potentially iPhone Fold. It's also expected to be part of macOS 25. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> With that in mind, there's every chance that some of the new features and technologies will be <a href="https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apples-advanced-ai-powered-siri-will-finally-debut-at-wwdc-claims-expert">shown off at WWDC</a>, which is confirmed for 8-12 June. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "alt": "Google Cloud Next '26 Opening Keynote - YouTube",
    "caption": "— Google Cloud Next '26 Opening Keynote",
    "component": "image",
    "credit": "",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "alt": "Google Cloud Next '26 Opening Keynote - YouTube",
        "data-aspect-ratio": "16/9",
        "loading": "lazy",
        "src": "https://img.youtube.com/vi/11PBno-cJ1g/maxresdefault.jpg",
      },
      "tag": "img",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "height": undefined,
    "imageurl": "https://img.youtube.com/vi/11PBno-cJ1g/maxresdefault.jpg",
    "warnings": [],
    "width": undefined,
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "elk-47c2e49a-4b3a-4c06-a0e0-589e13ff9185",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": "elk-47c2e49a-4b3a-4c06-a0e0-589e13ff9185",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-47c2e49a-4b3a-4c06-a0e0-589e13ff9185"> It's expected that Siri will gain agentic powers from Gemini, allowing to take actions on the users' behalf and better interact with other apps and services, with Apple's assistant also offering more of a chatbot experience like ChatGPT and Gemini. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> There's an expectation that Apple will refine the AI experience too, moving from slightly behind the pack, to showcasing how AI on smartphones can offer a more personalised and truly useful experience. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> Certainly, having struggled to meet expectations so far, everyone will be watching the Apple and Google partnership to see what comes next. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
